# Editor / OS cruft
.DS_Store

# Real pairing material dumped from the device by `just backup-storage`.
#
# This contains live BLE bond keys (LTK/IRK) for every paired host. Never commit
# it. Note that .gitignore is not a protection against `git add -f`, nor against
# the whole directory being archived or copied somewhere that gets published --
# keep an out-of-tree copy as well.
pico-numpad-config-backup.bin
